00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:19.640
it. The suit claims Tesla restricted independent shops from full diagnostic access, limiting

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:25.100
competition in after-sales service. Tesla has not commented publicly on the filing.

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:31.940
The case tests how dominant EV makers must share repair tools in China. Battery cell faults

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:37.160
rarely announce themselves until thermal runaway begins, yet the chemistry behind lithium

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:42.580
plating has been understood for decades. When excess lithium deposits on the anode during

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:47.780
fast-charging or low-temperature operation, the metal can pierce the separator and create

00:06:47.780 --> 00:06:48.720
internal shorts.

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:54.640
The UK Safety Report on Powerwall 2 simply applies that known mechanism to a consumer

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:57.600
product that must remain unattended for years.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:03.320
The regulatory response therefore centers on detection and removal rather than redesign.

00:07:04.220 --> 00:07:09.260
Tesla can remotely discharge suspect units because the packs already carry cellular connectivity

00:07:09.260 --> 00:07:10.640
and cloud monitoring.

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:16.640
This capability turns a potential recall into a targeted intervention that limits both

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.580
fire risk and customer disruption.

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:24.260
The larger implication is that stationary storage inherits the same cell aging physics

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:27.640
as vehicles, but operates under different duty cycles.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:33.640
A power wall cycles daily and sits at partial state of charge for long periods, conditions

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:38.640
that can accelerate plating if the battery management system does not actively counteract it.

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:44.260
Future pack designs will need tighter control loops or different cell formulations if residential

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:47.480
storage is to scale without repeated safety interventions.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:52.960
Before we go, watch for more details on the Powerwall replacement program in the coming

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:53.400
days.

